invalid type: string "COMPUTING AWARDS HANDBOOK \n \nNSBM|Faculty of Computing \nBachelor of Science in Multimedia \n \nBSc in Multimedia is a three-year degree program offered by NSBM with the approval of the UGC. This \nprogram focuses on idea-based education and main emphasis is given for conceptualization and ideation \nthrough the design process. \nOverview of the Program \name \nCredit \nÿÿÿ